            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150191,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>For paragraphs that actually serve as headings, a semantic alternative is a heading element, like the <code>h1</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Level Complete!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"You defeated the boss and earned 1200 points.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Next round starts at 5:00 PM and the speed boost lasts 2m 30s.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Save point location: 100 Main St. Austin, TX 78741\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"GG\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
