            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can use the <code>title</code> attribute with the <code>abbr</code> element to provide the full form of an abbreviation when hovering over or tapping it.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    Press the \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"abbr\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player Versus Player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"PvP\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"abbr\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" button to duel other players.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"85\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\" name=\"style.css\" visible-if=\"always\"><content /></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content /></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>title</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"Player Versus Player\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
